# Rugrats: Adventure in Gameland (PPSA23396): cross the splash logos, the "GAME MODE" selector, and
# the main menu into gameplay. Seconds are measured from the first pad poll. One-second Cross holds are
# poll-safe under slow rendering. The mode selector appears at roughly 33 s on a Linux hardware-Vulkan
# boot; Cross confirms the default mode and advances the menus, so repeated presses reach gameplay
# without directional navigation. Options is a fallback for a start-button title prompt.
